# **Zentra**

**Your Personal Knowledge Universe.**

Zentra is a beautifully designed, online-first digital book discovery and reading platform that brings books, authors, summaries, personal notes, and reading analytics together in one place.

The experience should combine the content discovery of Netflix, the author discovery experience of Spotify, and the immersive reading experience of a beautifully designed physical book.

Its central purpose is not just to let people open PDFs. It is to help them discover books, build a consistent reading habit, understand what they read, save important knowledge, and gradually build their own personal knowledge library.

